task.performance_improvement.rag (completed) {
  1. Move the coverage check before the LLM filter.                                                                      
  2. Skip the filter entirely for long-form requests. 
  3. Defer query expansion until the first retrieval pass fails coverage.                                                                            
  4. Tune sufficiency checks for enumerative questions.                                                                                              
  5. Reduce evidence batch size when coverage is already satisfied, to cut 35B prefill.
}

